IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-i-rg3-s485-2016`
IMPORT `sgta-i-dtl-notifications`

-- Tests of sgta-i-rg3-s485-2016.l4 and sgta-i-dtl-notifications.l4 (the second covers all eight designation notifications deposited from the e-Gazette).  Every case is a pair of days, CONDUCT first and READING second, and every expected value is
-- computed from the rule as the modules state it (the version with the latest published day among those published on or before the reading day whose effective day
-- is on or before the conduct day) applied to: S 685/2011 (published 27 Dec 2011, in operation 28 Dec 2011), S 485/2016 (published 3 Oct 2016, deemed in operation
-- 1 Oct 2016), S 23/2011 and S 24/2011 (published 17 Jan 2011, in operation 21 Jan 2011), and the 2002 Revised Edition (1 Jan 2003 assumed).

